id=ptune
name=Pixel Tune
version=v1.6.1
versionCode=161
author=JoshuaDoes
description=Installs a new system cpuset to allow more breathing room for core system components and unlocks the potential of the rest of the system, improving battery life and performance all at once. Must be reinstalled using the Magisk button labelled 'Action' after any updates to your ROM, kernel, or Magisk install! Must be uninstalled prior to OTAs if Magisk doesn't live in boot (as is the case on Pixel 7 series and newer). Uninstalls are safe, read the README!
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JoshuaDoes/ptune/dev/update.json
